---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { PromptDemo } from "../components/PromptDemo";
import { ArrowRight, Blocks, Layers2 } from "lucide-react";
import { onboardingStages } from "../data/onboarding";
---

<Layout title="看见 AI Coding，从想法到作品">
  <section class="home-intro">
    <span class="eyebrow">
      <span class="live-dot" /> THE AI CODING SHOWCASE
    </span>
    <h1>
      看见 AI Coding。<span>从想法，到作品。</span>
    </h1>
    <p>刚接触 Vibe Coding？从装好工具、建好项目开始，再看需求怎样变成一个作品。</p>
  </section>
  <section class="onboarding-roadmap" aria-labelledby="roadmap-title">
    <div class="roadmap-heading">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">START HERE / 从零上手</span>
        <h2 id="roadmap-title">第一次接触，按这条路线看。</h2>
      </div>
      <a href="/setup">观看入门流程 <ArrowRight size={14} /></a>
    </div>
    <ol>
      {
        onboardingStages.map((stage, i) => (
          <li>
            <a href={`/setup#${stage.id}`}>
              <span class="roadmap-number">0{i + 1}</span>
              <div>
                <h3>{stage.label}</h3>
                <p>{stage.short}</p>
              </div>
              <ArrowRight size={14} />
            </a>
          </li>
        ))
      }
    </ol>
    <p class="roadmap-note">不是安装任务，也不需要跟着敲命令。先看懂过程，再看完整案例。</p>
  </section>
  <PromptDemo client:load />
  <div class="case-choices">
    <a class="case-choice" href="/case/from-scratch">
      <span class="case-choice-icon">
        <Blocks size={22} />
      </span>
      <div>
        <small>CASE 01 · 从零开始</small>
        <h2>从一句话，到一个网站。</h2>
        <p>五步需求分析 → 制作计划 → 代码 → 预览 → 交付</p>
      </div>
      <ArrowRight size={19} />
    </a>
    <a class="case-choice" href="/case/todo-app">
      <span class="case-choice-icon green">
        <Layers2 size={22} />
      </span>
      <div>
        <small>CASE 02 · 已有项目</small>
        <h2>给 Todo 增加一条备注。</h2>
        <p>读项目 → 分层修改 → 验证数据流</p>
      </div>
      <ArrowRight size={19} />
    </a>
  </div>
  <p class="home-footnote">
    所有内容均为预设演示，无需安装工具或连接 AI。
    <a href="/setup">
      从安装工具开始了解 <ArrowRight size={12} />
    </a>
  </p>
</Layout>
